{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Deep Sea Sweep, you play as a small fish who wants to give the seafloor its former beauty back. There are heaps of filthy treasure chests down there! Luckily, your yellow neighbour seems to appreciate them a lot, and can probably help you get rid of them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Switch between swimming and classic platform movement</strong> by carrying treasures, dropping them on enemies or switches to progress. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/extras/pickupchest-cut.gif?t=1741360765\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through many <strong>short but challenging</strong> <strong>levels</strong> mixing action and puzzle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controls are easy to pick up, customizable, and allow tight movements.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The worldmap has many paths including secret ones. <strong>Play through each biome in the way you like!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in tranquil pixel art environments, and meet colorful and cute characters and enemies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look out for secrets! Find each level's stars to unlock secret harder levels and shortcuts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change your character's appearance and style with all the pearls you've collected.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself by going for better times in each level.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/extras/tragic_backstory_cutscene.gif?t=1741360765\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some say deep down at the bottom of the ocean lies a magic pearl that grants wishes... Maybe this would simplify your task. But in the meantime, there's golden trash to take out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948030?t=1741360765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741360765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/b9493dee4e173202aa64943bb557f5317346b931/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741360765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/b9493dee4e173202aa64943bb557f5317346b931/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741360765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3068600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Deep Sea Sweep, you play as a small fish who wants to give the seafloor its former beauty back. There are heaps of filthy treasure chests down there! Luckily, your yellow neighbour seems to appreciate them a lot, and can probably help you get rid of them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Switch between swimming and classic platform movement</strong> by carrying treasures, dropping them on enemies or switches to progress. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/extras/pickupchest-cut.gif?t=1741360765\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through many <strong>short but challenging</strong> <strong>levels</strong> mixing action and puzzle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controls are easy to pick up, customizable, and allow tight movements.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The worldmap has many paths including secret ones. <strong>Play through each biome in the way you like!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in tranquil pixel art environments, and meet colorful and cute characters and enemies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look out for secrets! Find each level's stars to unlock secret harder levels and shortcuts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change your character's appearance and style with all the pearls you've collected.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself by going for better times in each level.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/extras/tragic_backstory_cutscene.gif?t=1741360765\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some say deep down at the bottom of the ocean lies a magic pearl that grants wishes... Maybe this would simplify your task. But in the meantime, there's golden trash to take out!</p>","developers":["Angler Panache"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948030/header.jpg?t=1741360765","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257089393,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089393/movie480.mp4?t=1741020214","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089393/movie_max.mp4?t=1741020214"},"name":"Deep Sea Sweep 3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.stea